{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16084","headline":"九仙公主旧庄 · 王建","name":"九仙公主旧庄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仙居五里外门西，石路亲回御马蹄。\n天使来栽宫里树，罗衣自买院前溪。\n野牛行傍浇花井，本主分将灌药畦。\n楼上凤皇飞去後，白云红叶属山鸡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16084.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16084","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}